{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Here are some words that begin with さ and し that are helpful for the exam:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Note that 仕口（しくち） and 仕事（しぐとぅ） are synonyms and would like be on the exam, but the former is more used.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "地豆（じーまーみ）= peanut (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "仕口（しくち）= work (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "仕事（しぐとぅ）= work (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "好（し）ちゅん = to like / to love (v.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "捨（し）てぃーん or 捨（し）てぃゆん = to throw away / to trash (v.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "しに = shin (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "死（し）ぬん = to die (v.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "しば = lip / tongue (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "じゅり or じる = which?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "状（じょー） = letter (n.) [as in what you put in an envelope]",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "門（じょー）= gate (n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "上手（じょーじ）= the fact to be good at something (n. / adj., by default n.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
